description:
In repos/activity-api/src/lib/posterior-update.ts, add an observability log line recording why a variant posterior update was skipped. The goal is instrumentation, not repair: the skip decision itself must remain exactly as it is today.

Why this is the requested change. This function decides whether an execution's outcome moves a Thompson posterior, and when it decides not to, it emits no record at all. On the live substrate one arm has held at alpha 53.65 and beta 19.22 for ten hours while thirty two not-reached verdicts landed on its rows, while other arms' posteriors moved freely in the same windows. Five candidate explanations were checked against the source and refuted, because the decision itself is invisible from outside. A skip that leaves no trace cannot be diagnosed by reading code; it has to be observed.

Perform exactly one replacement. Find the sole occurrence of this line:
  const skipVariantUpdate = tierClass === 'all_deterministic' || trace.metadata?.information_yield === 'idle';

Replace it with these lines:
  const skipVariantUpdate = tierClass === 'all_deterministic' || trace.metadata?.information_yield === 'idle';
  if (skipVariantUpdate || ungraded || (alphaDelta === 0 && betaDelta === 0)) {
    logger.info('posterior variant update SKIPPED', {
      activity_id: activityId,
      reason: skipVariantUpdate ? (tierClass === 'all_deterministic' ? 'all_deterministic' : 'information_yield_idle') : (ungraded ? 'reach_ungraded' : 'zero_deltas'),
      reach_verdict: reachVerdict,
      tier_class: tierClass,
      alpha_delta: alphaDelta,
      beta_delta: betaDelta,
      has_tags: Array.isArray(trace.tags) && trace.tags.length > 0,
      task_count: Array.isArray(trace.tasks) ? trace.tasks.length : 0,
    });
  }

The first line is reproduced verbatim, so the constant and every downstream use of it are unchanged; the added block only reads values and logs. Every identifier it references is already declared above this point in the same function — activityId, reachVerdict, ungraded, alphaDelta, betaDelta and tierClass — and trace is the function parameter. The logger is already imported and used elsewhere in this file. The three-way reason expression distinguishes the mutually exclusive skip causes, which is the entire point: today all of them are indistinguishable from outside.

One replacement, one file. Change nothing else.

